<title>CHINA: YAOHAU PILKINGTON INTERIM NET DOWN.</title>
<headline>YAOHAU PILKINGTON INTERIM NET DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 31, 1997</p>
<p>(In millions of yuan unless stated, against 1996 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		 304.492	vs  229.533</p>
<p> Net profit		48.366	vs   54.809</p>
<p> Net assets per share   3.08  yuan vs    3.01 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share     0.10  yuan vs    0.11 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Yaohua Pilkington Glass Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: The results were contained in a company statement released by the Shanghai Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>The figures are unaudited. Chinese securities rules do not require listed firms to have their interim results audited.</p>
<p>Trading in the company's A and B shares will be suspended on Friday morning and will resume in the afternoon.</p>
<p>-- Shanghai Newsroom (86) 21-6279 7004 Fax: 6279 7174</p>
</text>
